            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> This is not about changing the default terminal color, this is about how it break every terminal that follow OS dark-light preference, this is non-trivial imo 🤔\r\n\r\nThe effect of following OS dark-light preference in terminal emulator is to effectively change its color scheme (which means changing its \"default\" background color). If using \"\\027]111\\027\\\\\" OSC won't help, then there are even more reasons to not support this use case.",
