        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "@wroyca, `setup_termbg_sync()` now uses OSC 111 to by default to reset to terminal's default background. With the option to use previous approach.\n\nThe main drivers for this change were:\n- nvim-mini/MiniMax#25 - `tmux` doesn't quite handle the transparent terminal background.\n- `st` [got support for OSC 111](https://git.suckless.org/st/commit/d6c431859c6c0201e0668ed24a9f17cebf0a68f5.html) in its main codebase (not as a patch).\n\nI think the latest `main` should work better in the use case described in this issue.",
            "created_at": "2025-12-20T14:10:39Z",
            "html_url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/1128#issuecomment-3677850558",
